---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy">
  <main>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20 prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 uppercase">Last updated: 6 June 2026</p>

      <p>This website is operated by Gabriel Brückner. If you contact me by email, I may collect your name, email address, and any information you include in your message. I use this information only to respond to your enquiry and manage potential project conversations.</p>

      <p>If you choose to schedule a call using my booking link, your booking details will be processed through Google Calendar's appointment scheduling tools. I use this information only to arrange and manage the call.</p>

      <p>I may also receive limited technical information through my website hosting or analytics tools, such as pages visited, browser type, and general usage data. This helps me understand how the site is used and improve it.</p>

      <p>I do not sell your personal data. I may share limited data with service providers that help me run the website, such as hosting, analytics, and scheduling providers, only where necessary.</p>

      <p>I keep enquiry and booking data only for as long as needed to respond to your message, arrange calls, or maintain relevant business records.</p>

      <p>You may have rights in relation to your personal data, including the right to request access, correction, or deletion, subject to applicable law. You also have the right to complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office (ICO).</p>

      <p>If you have any questions about this policy, you can contact me at <a href="mailto:mail@gabriel-brueckner.com">mail@gabriel-brueckner.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
